low/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"CineFlow 基于 Electron + Vite 构建，使用 TMDB 作为元数据源，支持电影、电视剧、节目、演员、关键词与类型发现，并提供每日推荐、自然语言搜索、风格探索、个性化推荐、介绍页、灵动岛模式与应用内播放（HLS / DASH / FLV）等功能。TMDB Key、代理与偏好设置保存在本机，不写入源码或安装包。","name":"CineFlow","packageUrl":"https://github.com/incldue/CineFlow","publisher":"debu8ger","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/incldue","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/incldue/CineFlow/releases/tag/V3.2.0","tags":["tmdb","影视","播放","电影","电视剧","视频"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/incldue","releaseDate":"2026-09-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/incldue/CineFlow/releases/tag/V3.2.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/i/incldue/CineFlow/3.2.0/incldue.CineFlow.yaml","sha256":"a51c174e89294312e5b6c81a6b30c0e9193d3af6bfb35b8643d07f1af3bde0a8"},{"path":"manifests/i/incldue/CineFlow/3.2.0/incldue.CineFlow.installer.yaml","sha256":"52d1b89bd3dd9454ec85a0b010a77fee7ba5c01055f7d47f72f77264b7999ac6"},{"path":"manifests/i/incldue/CineFlow/3.2.0/incldue.CineFlow.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"b32b175248061d2a3a7bf73a26a2548c590931b1e4d1d18c26b2fa9a130a84b6"},{"path":"manifests/i/incldue/CineFlow/3.2.0/incldue.CineFlow.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"26ee1173693c3020ff96bc781b3e6dbcdd07e917aa0a36df04ece637dd2d6878"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"3.2.0"}